      "source": [
        "## 1. 各音源の振幅比の事前推定\n",
        "\n",
        "各音源が混合されず単体で収録された音声を用いて，事前に振幅比を計算します．\n",
        "DUETでは，この振幅比に基づき音源を分離します．\n",
        "\n",
        "まずはSTFTのパラメータを設定します．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "LbXxm_4ZlDlm"
      },
      "source": [
        "# セグメント長，シフト長の指定\n",
        "n_seg = 1024\n",
        "n_overlap = round(1024*(1/2))"
      ],
      "execution_count": 111,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1glJd7wFy0V8"
      },
      "source": [
        "音源A，音源Bのみの音声をそれぞれSTFTします．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "akjlNtNrKoY6"
      },
      "source": [
        "# 音源Aのスペクトログラム\n",
        "_, _, Xa_l = sg.stft(soundA_l, fs=fs, nperseg=n_seg, noverlap=n_overlap) # 左チャンネル\n",
        "_, _, Xa_r = sg.stft(soundA_r, fs=fs, nperseg=n_seg, noverlap=n_overlap) # 右チャンネル\n",
        "# 音源Bのスペクトログラム\n",
        "_, _, Xb_l = sg.stft(soundB_l, fs=fs, nperseg=n_seg, noverlap=n_overlap) # 左チャンネル\n",
        "_, _, Xb_r = sg.stft(soundB_r, fs=fs, nperseg=n_seg, noverlap=n_overlap) # 右チャンネル"
      ],
      "execution_count": 112,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "uLlhm9P_lIYM"
      },
      "source": [
        "信号のSTFT結果から振幅比を計算します．\n",
        "音源Aにおける左チャンネルのスペクトログラムを`X_al`，右チャンネルのスペクトログラムを`X_ar`とします．\n",
        "このとき，振幅比は\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "R_a = |X_al|/|X_ar|\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "で計算されます．音源Bにおいても振幅比を同様に計算し，`R_b`とします．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "moZZZNUjkvcf"
      },
      "source": [
        "#↓↓ 自身で書き換えて，音源A・Bそれぞれの振幅比R_a, R_bを計算する．\n",
        "#--------------------------------------\n",
        "R_a = np.ones(Xa_r.shape)\n",
        "R_a = R_a * (np.abs(Xa_l) / np.abs(Xa_r))\n",
        "R_b = np.ones(Xb_r.shape)\n",
        "R_b = R_b * (np.abs(Xb_l) / np.abs(Xb_r))\n",
        "#--------------------------------------\n",
        "#↑↑ここまで"
      ],
      "execution_count": 113,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "_IqmYD3RpqLR"
      },
      "source": [
        "振幅比のヒストグラムを計算し，最頻値を計算します．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "GiPiLYGatH6h"
      },
      "source": [
        "# 音源Aにおける振幅比 R_a のヒストグラムと最頻値\n",
        "hist_ra, edge_ra = np.histogram(R_a.flatten(), bins=200, range=(0,4))\n",
        "Ra_mod = edge_ra[hist_ra.argmax()] # ヒストグラム hist_ra の最頻値\n",
        "\n",
        "# 音源Bにおける振幅比 R_b のヒストグラムと最頻値\n",
        "hist_rb, edge_rb = np.histogram(R_b.flatten(), bins=200, range=(0,4))\n",
        "Rb_mod = edge_rb[hist_rb.argmax()] # ヒストグラム hist_ra の最頻値"
      ],
      "execution_count": 114,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "6TP4YFZMLmV5"
      },
      "source": [
        "得られた最頻値を出力します．"
